---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import config from '../data/config.json';

const lastUpdated = 'May 16, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Bosque Works"
  description="Privacy policy for Bosque Works LLC — how we collect, use, and protect your information, including SMS communications."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="page-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </header>

      <section class="prose">
        <p class="lede">
          Bosque Works LLC ("Bosque Works," "we," "us," or "our") respects your privacy.
          This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and the
          choices you have. It applies to bosqueworks.com and to other websites and
          services operated by Bosque Works LLC, including any lead-generation landing
          pages we operate on behalf of our contractor partners.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect information you provide directly to us, including:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Contact information:</strong> name, email address, phone number (including mobile phone number), and postal or property address.</li>
          <li><strong>Inquiry information:</strong> details you provide about a service request, such as a description of work needed, timeline, and supporting photos.</li>
          <li><strong>Communications:</strong> records of your messages, emails, and phone calls with us, including call recordings where permitted by law.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We also collect limited information automatically when you visit our websites:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> pages viewed, referring sites, browser type, device type, and approximate geographic location (derived from IP address).</li>
          <li><strong>Cookies and similar technologies:</strong> small data files used for basic site functionality and aggregate analytics. See "Cookies and Analytics" below.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Respond to your inquiries and provide the services you request.</li>
          <li>Connect you with a licensed local contractor (for lead-generation services).</li>
          <li>Send service-related communications (such as appointment confirmations, follow-ups, and updates) by phone, email, or SMS.</li>
          <li>Operate, maintain, and improve our websites and services.</li>
          <li>Comply with legal obligations and enforce our Terms of Service.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. SMS Communications</h2>
        <p>
          If you provide your mobile phone number through a Bosque Works form, by replying
          to a message, or by verbal opt-in during a call, you consent to receive SMS text
          messages from Bosque Works LLC or from a contractor partner on our behalf
          regarding the inquiry or service you requested.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Message frequency:</strong> SMS message frequency varies based on your interaction with us. You may receive transactional messages (such as confirmation of an inquiry, appointment reminders, or follow-ups from a contractor) and, where you have opted in, occasional service updates.</li>
          <li><strong>Message and data rates:</strong> Message and data rates may apply, depending on your mobile carrier and plan.</li>
          <li><strong>Help:</strong> Reply <strong>HELP</strong> to any SMS for assistance, or contact us at <a href={`mailto:${config.owner.email}`}>{config.owner.email}</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Opt out:</strong> Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any SMS at any time to unsubscribe. Once unsubscribed, you will receive a confirmation message and will no longer receive marketing or follow-up SMS from that program.</li>
          <li><strong>Carriers:</strong> Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. How We Share Your Information</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>Mobile information (including your phone number and SMS opt-in data)
          will not be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional
          purposes.</strong> No mobile information is sold, rented, or transferred to data
          brokers or advertisers under any circumstances.
        </p>
        <p>We share your other information only in the following limited circumstances:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>With a contractor partner you have requested service from.</strong> If you submit a service inquiry through one of our lead-generation pages (for example, a request for a roof inspection), we share your inquiry — including your name, phone, address, and the details of your request — with the licensed local contractor assigned to your area, so that contractor can contact you about the work.</li>
          <li><strong>With service providers we use to operate.</strong> We use trusted third-party services for hosting, email delivery (Resend), SMS delivery (Twilio), spam protection (Cloudflare Turnstile), and analytics (Cloudflare Web Analytics). These providers process information only on our behalf and under contractual obligations to protect it.</li>
          <li><strong>When required by law.</strong> We may disclose information if compelled by valid legal process or to protect the rights, safety, or property of Bosque Works, our users, or others.</li>
          <li><strong>In a business transfer.</strong> If Bosque Works LLC is involved in a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets, your information may be transferred as part of that transaction; you will be notified before any such transfer.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do not sell personal information as defined under applicable U.S. state
          privacy laws.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Cookies and Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          Our websites use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which collects aggregated, anonymized
          usage data without using cookies and without tracking individuals across sites.
          We do not use third-party advertising cookies or cross-site tracking technologies.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Data Security</h2>
        <p>
          We use reasonable administrative, technical, and physical safeguards to protect
          the information we collect, including HTTPS encryption in transit and access
          controls on stored data. However, no method of transmission or storage is
          completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Your Rights and Choices</h2>
        <p>You have the following rights regarding your information:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Access and correction:</strong> request a copy of the information we hold about you, or ask us to correct inaccurate information.</li>
          <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> request that we delete information we hold about you, subject to legal retention obligations.</li>
          <li><strong>Opt out of SMS:</strong> reply STOP to any SMS message at any time.</li>
          <li><strong>Opt out of email:</strong> use the unsubscribe link in any marketing email, or contact us directly.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise any of these rights, email
          <a href={`mailto:${config.owner.email}`}>{config.owner.email}</a> or call
          <a href={`tel:${config.owner.phone}`}>(254) 277-2131</a>. We will respond within
          30 days.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Our services are not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly
          collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has
          provided information to us, please contact us so we can delete it.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will revise
          the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. Material changes will be
          communicated through a notice on our website or by direct contact.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or about how we handle your
          information, contact us at:
        </p>
        <address class="contact-card">
          <strong>{config.owner.businessLegalName}</strong><br />
          {config.owner.location}<br />
          Email: <a href={`mailto:${config.owner.email}`}>{config.owner.email}</a><br />
          Phone: <a href={`tel:${config.owner.phone}`}>(254) 277-2131</a>
        </address>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    background: var(--cream);
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    min-height: 60vh;
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    color: #78350F;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .page-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    color: #1C1917;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .updated {
    color: #78716C;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .prose {
    color: #44403C;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .prose .lede {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #292524;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    color: #1C1917;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .prose p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .prose ul {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }
  .prose li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .prose a {
    color: #D97706;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .prose a:hover {
    color: #78350F;
  }
  .contact-card {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #E7E5E4;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-style: normal;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
</style>
